  "text": "Lilacs,<br>False blue,<br>White,<br>Purple,<br>Color of lilac.<br>Heart-leaves of lilac all over New England,<br>Roots of lilac under all the soil of New England,<br>Lilac in me because I am New England,<br>Because my roots are in it,<br>Because my leaves are of it,<br>Because my flowers are for it,<br>Because it is my country<br>And I speak to it of itself<br>And sing of it with my own voice<br>Since certainly it is mine.",
